[{"id": 4176, "text": "<h2>How to play:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Player 1 chooses an action and mimes doing it (acts it out without talking). For example, you could mime putting on a hat.</li>\n<li>Player 2 guesses what Player 1 is doing.</li>\n<li>Player 1 does the action again but changes <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">how</span> they are doing it, e.g. you could be putting on your hat <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">angrily</span>.</li>\n<li>Player 2 guesses <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">how</span> Player 1 is doing the action,</li>\n<li>When Player 2 has guessed <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">how</span> Player 1 is doing the action, swap over.</li>\n<li>Player 2 repeats the game from step 1. </li>\n<li>Take it in turns to have some more goes!</li>\n</ol>\n<br></br>\nRoll the die for some ideas of how to change your actions:", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 2905, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": null, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 43144878, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXTDICE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 2905, "dimensions": null, "